{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ACCOUNT PLAYER REGISTRATION (templates/customers/account.json; review sheet templates/page.player-registration-preview.json)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"Your players" card at the top of the account page, above the order list (also shows for accounts with no orders).
Each player is named by the date it was bought (or registered), with an optional "belongs to" name. Never by pack or
colour.

Where players come from (trusted sources only, nothing the customer types):
1. Their own orders: one row per player unit in line items with product type Player, Starter Pack or Schools Pack, or
   the tag "Player Bundle" (same rule as snippets/customer-owns-player). Cancelled, voided and refunded orders skipped.
2. Customer metafield players.data (JSON), written only by the player link routes on the Voxblock Account app
   (Google Cloud Functions, app proxy /apps/voxblock, see services/player-link/README.md):
   {
     "nicknames": { "<key>": "Isla" },
     "linked":  [ { "key", "bought": "YYYY-MM-DD" | null, "registered": "YYYY-MM-DD", "source", "owner": "t***@g***.com" | "", "link" } ],
     "shared":  [ { "key", "with": "a***@h***.co.uk", "link" } ],
     "pending": [ { "email": "t***@g***.com", "sent": "YYYY-MM-DD" } ]
   }
   linked = players this account sees through a confirmed link (owner = the other account, redacted) or registered to
   itself (owner blank). shared = this account's own players another account has linked (shown with Unlink).

Register / add a player: email + where it came from. The service emails that address (Klaviyo, metric
"Player link requested") with Yes / No. Yes links the player into this account; the click lands on the account page
(Shopify sends them to sign in first if needed). The screen never says whether the email has an account or a player.

Calls (form posts to the app proxy; Shopify signs each request with the signed-in customer's ID):
  POST {service_path}/request   email, source
  POST {service_path}/nickname  key, name
  POST {service_path}/unlink    link
"Preview state" forces sample data for design review (page.player-registration-preview); calls are faked there.
Clicks send vs_yoto_click { target } through data-vs-track / posthog: reg_submit, reg_player_link, reg_nickname, reg_unlink.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign forced = s.preview_state | default: 'live'
  assign months = s.guarantee_months | plus: 0
  assign service = s.service_path | default: '/apps/voxblock/players'

  assign data = nil
  if forced == 'live' and customer
    assign data = customer.metafields.players.data.value
  endif
  assign nicknames = data.nicknames

  assign player_count = 0
  if forced == 'registered'
    assign player_count = 3
  elsif forced == 'live' and customer
    for order in customer.orders limit: 50
      if order.cancelled or order.financial_status == 'refunded' or order.financial_status == 'voided'
        continue
      endif
      for item in order.line_items
        assign item_type = item.product.type | downcase
        if item_type == 'player' or item_type == 'starter pack' or item_type == 'schools pack' or item.product.tags contains 'Player Bundle'
          assign player_count = player_count | plus: item.quantity
        endif
      endfor
    endfor
    assign player_count = player_count | plus: data.linked.size
  endif

  assign show_section = false
  if customer or forced != 'live'
    assign show_section = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if show_section -%}
<div class="container player-reg" id="register-player-{{ section.id }}" data-player-reg-root data-service="{{ service | escape }}" data-preview="{% if forced != 'live' %}true{% endif %}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if forced != 'live' -%}<p class="player-reg__review-label">Preview: {{ forced | replace: '_', ' ' }}</p>{%- endif -%}

  <div class="player-reg__card">
    <div class="player-reg__head">
      {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="subheading">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if player_count > 0 -%}
        <h2 class="h4">{{ s.registered_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if s.registered_text != blank -%}<p class="player-reg__lede">{{ s.registered_text | replace: '[months]', months | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <h2 class="h4">{{ s.form_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if s.form_text != blank -%}<p class="player-reg__lede">{{ s.form_text | replace: '[months]', months | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if player_count > 0 -%}
      <ul class="player-reg__list" role="list">
        {%- if forced == 'registered' -%}
          {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: 'sample-1', start: '2026-09-02', date_word: 'Bought', nickname: 'Isla', shared_with: 'g***@h******.co.uk', link: 'sample-link-1', months: months, money_back: true -%}
          {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: 'sample-2', start: '2025-11-28', date_word: 'Bought', owner: 't***@g****.com', link: 'sample-link-2', months: months -%}
          {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: 'sample-3', start: '2025-06-02', date_word: 'Registered', source: 'Amazon', nickname: 'Rory', months: months -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for order in customer.orders limit: 50 -%}
            {%- if order.cancelled or order.financial_status == 'refunded' or order.financial_status == 'voided' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- for item in order.line_items -%}
              {%- assign item_type = item.product.type | downcase -%}
              {%- if item_type == 'player' or item_type == 'starter pack' or item_type == 'schools pack' or item.product.tags contains 'Player Bundle' -%}
                {%- for unit in (1..item.quantity) -%}
                  {%- capture key -%}{{ order.id }}-{{ item.id }}-{{ unit }}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- assign share = data.shared | where: 'key', key | first -%}
                  {%- assign bought = order.created_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' -%}
                  {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: key, start: bought, date_word: 'Bought', nickname: nicknames[key], shared_with: share.with, link: share.link, months: months, money_back: true -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- for p in data.linked -%}
            {%- if p.bought != blank -%}
              {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: p.key, start: p.bought, date_word: 'Bought', source: p.source, owner: p.owner, link: p.link, nickname: nicknames[p.key], months: months, money_back: true -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- render 'player-reg-item', key: p.key, start: p.registered, date_word: 'Registered', source: p.source, owner: p.owner, link: p.link, nickname: nicknames[p.key], months: months -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- liquid
      assign pending = data.pending
      if forced == 'registered'
        assign pending = nil
      endif
    -%}
    {%- for p in pending -%}
      <p class="player-reg__pending">{{ s.pending_text | replace: '[email]', p.email | escape }}</p>
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- comment -%} Register / add form: open when there are no players, behind a link otherwise {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if player_count > 0 -%}
      <p class="player-reg__foot" data-add-toggle-wrap><button type="button" class="player-reg__link-button player-reg__link-button--strong" data-add-toggle>{{ s.another_text | escape }}</button></p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="player-reg__form-wrap" data-add-wrap {% if player_count > 0 %}hidden{% endif %}>
      {%- if player_count > 0 -%}<p class="player-reg__lede">{{ s.form_text | replace: '[months]', months | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}

      {%- if forced == 'sent' -%}
        {%- render 'banner', status: 'success', content: s.sent_text -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <form class="player-reg__form" data-add-form novalidate>
          <div class="player-reg__hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
          <div class="player-reg__row">
            {%- render 'input', type: 'email', name: 'email', label: s.email_label, maxlength: 120, autocomplete: 'email', required: true -%}
            {%- capture source_options -%}
              <option value="" disabled selected></option>
              <option value="Voxblock website">Voxblock website</option>
              <option value="Amazon">Amazon</option>
              <option value="A shop">A shop</option>
              <option value="A gift">It was a gift</option>
              <option value="Other">Somewhere else</option>
            {%- endcapture -%}
            {%- render 'select', name: 'source', label: 'Where did it come from?', options: source_options, required: true -%}
          </div>
          {%- if s.email_hint != blank -%}<p class="player-reg__hint">{{ s.email_hint | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <p class="player-reg__error" data-add-error role="alert" hidden></p>
          {%- render 'button', content: s.submit_text, type: 'submit', size: 'lg', stretch: true, secondary: true -%}
        </form>
        <div data-add-done hidden>{%- render 'banner', status: 'success', content: s.sent_text -%}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if player_count == 0 and s.buy_text != blank -%}
      <p class="player-reg__buy">
        {{ s.buy_text | replace: '[months]', months | escape }}
        <a href="{{ s.player_url | default: '/products/voxblock-player' }}" data-vs-track="reg_player_link">{{ s.buy_link_text | escape }}</a>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('register-player-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var service = root.getAttribute('data-service');
    var preview = root.getAttribute('data-preview') === 'true';
    var failText = {{ s.error_text | json }};

    function track(target) {
      if (window.posthog) window.posthog.capture('vs_yoto_click', { target: target, page: window.location.pathname });
    }

    // POST to the app proxy (form-encoded so Shopify forwards it as-is). Preview fakes success.
    function call(path, fields) {
      if (preview) return new Promise(function (resolve) { setTimeout(function () { resolve({ ok: true }); }, 400); });
      return fetch(service + path, {
        method: 'POST',
        credentials: 'same-origin',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded', 'Accept': 'application/json' },
        body: new URLSearchParams(fields).toString()
      }).then(function (r) { return r.json().catch(function () { return { ok: r.ok }; }); });
    }

    // Add / register
    var addToggle = root.querySelector('[data-add-toggle]');
    var addWrap = root.querySelector('[data-add-wrap]');
    if (addToggle && addWrap) addToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
      addWrap.hidden = false;
      addToggle.closest('[data-add-toggle-wrap]').hidden = true;
      var first = addWrap.querySelector('input[name="email"]');
      if (first) first.focus();
    });

    var form = root.querySelector('[data-add-form]');
    if (form) form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var error = form.querySelector('[data-add-error]');
      var email = form.elements.email.value.trim();
      var source = form.elements.source.value;
      if (form.elements.website.value) return;
      if (!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email) || !source) {
        error.textContent = {{ s.missing_text | json }};
        error.hidden = false;
        return;
      }
      error.hidden = true;
      var button = form.querySelector('[type="submit"]');
      button.disabled = true;
      track('reg_submit');
      call('/request', { email: email, source: source }).then(function (res) {
        if (res && res.ok) {
          form.hidden = true;
          root.querySelector('[data-add-done]').hidden = false;
        } else {
          error.textContent = (res && res.message) || failText;
          error.hidden = false;
          button.disabled = false;
        }
      }).catch(function () { error.textContent = failText; error.hidden = false; button.disabled = false; });
    });

    // "This player belongs to"
    root.querySelectorAll('[data-player-key]').forEach(function (item) {
      var key = item.getAttribute('data-player-key');
      var view = item.querySelector('[data-belongs-view]');
      var nameForm = item.querySelector('[data-belongs-form]');
      item.querySelectorAll('[data-belongs-edit]').forEach(function (b) {
        b.addEventListener('click', function () { view.hidden = true; nameForm.hidden = false; nameForm.elements.name.focus(); });
      });
      nameForm.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        var name = nameForm.elements.name.value.trim().slice(0, 30);
        track('reg_nickname');
        call('/nickname', { key: key, name: name }).then(function (res) {
          if (!res || !res.ok) { alertInline(nameForm, failText); return; }
          view.innerHTML = '';
          if (name) {
            view.appendChild(document.createTextNode('Belongs to '));
            var strong = document.createElement('strong'); strong.textContent = name; view.appendChild(strong);
            view.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' · '));
          }
          var edit = document.createElement('button');
          edit.type = 'button'; edit.className = 'player-reg__link-button';
          edit.textContent = name ? 'Change' : 'Who does this player belong to?';
          edit.addEventListener('click', function () { view.hidden = true; nameForm.hidden = false; });
          view.appendChild(edit);
          nameForm.hidden = true; view.hidden = false;
        }).catch(function () { alertInline(nameForm, failText); });
      });

      var unlink = item.querySelector('[data-unlink]');
      if (unlink) {
        var ask = unlink.querySelector('[data-unlink-ask]');
        var confirmBox = unlink.querySelector('[data-unlink-confirm]');
        ask.addEventListener('click', function () { ask.hidden = true; confirmBox.hidden = false; });
        unlink.querySelector('[data-unlink-no]').addEventListener('click', function () { confirmBox.hidden = true; ask.hidden = false; });
        unlink.querySelector('[data-unlink-yes]').addEventListener('click', function () {
          track('reg_unlink');
          call('/unlink', { link: unlink.getAttribute('data-unlink') }).then(function (res) {
            if (res && res.ok) {
              if (preview) { item.remove(); } else { window.location.reload(); }
            } else { confirmBox.textContent = failText; }
          }).catch(function () { confirmBox.textContent = failText; });
        });
      }
    });

    function alertInline(el, text) {
      var p = el.querySelector('.player-reg__error') || document.createElement('p');
      p.className = 'player-reg__error'; p.setAttribute('role', 'alert'); p.textContent = text;
      el.appendChild(p);
    }
  })();
</script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Player registration",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section--player-registration",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "guarantee_months", "label": "Guarantee length (months)", "min": 6, "max": 60, "step": 6, "default": 12, "info": "Confirm before going live. Bought players: from the order date. Registered players: from the registration date." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "service_path", "label": "Player service path", "default": "/apps/voxblock/players", "info": "App proxy path of the player link service." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Your players" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Players listed" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "registered_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Your registered players" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "registered_text", "label": "Text", "default": "Each player has a [months]-month guarantee." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "another_text", "label": "Add link", "default": "Add another player" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pending_text", "label": "Waiting line", "default": "Waiting for [email] to confirm." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Register form" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "form_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Register your player" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "form_text", "label": "Text", "default": "Enter the email the player was bought with. We'll email that address to confirm, then the player shows here with its [months]-month guarantee." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "email_label", "label": "Email label", "default": "Email the player was bought with" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "email_hint", "label": "Email hint", "default": "Bought it yourself? Use your own email." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "missing_text", "label": "Missing details", "default": "Add an email and where the player came from." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "submit_text", "label": "Button", "default": "Send confirmation email" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sent_text", "label": "Sent message", "default": "Done. If that email can confirm, we've sent it a message with a Yes button. Once they say yes, the player shows here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "error_text", "label": "Error message", "default": "Sorry, that didn't work. Please try again in a minute." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "No player yet" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "buy_text", "label": "Text", "default": "No player yet? Bought from us, it comes with the [months]-month guarantee and our 100-day money-back guarantee." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "buy_link_text", "label": "Link", "default": "See the player" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "player_url", "label": "Link URL", "default": "/products/voxblock-player" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Review only" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "preview_state", "label": "Preview state", "default": "live",
      "options": [
        { "value": "live", "label": "Live" },
        { "value": "registered", "label": "Players (sample)" },
        { "value": "form", "label": "Form" },
        { "value": "sent", "label": "Sent" }
      ],
      "info": "Leave on Live on the account page."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Player registration" }]
}
{% endschema %}
